0..73 Comment "// A parameter that varies by generator stands as an index of its family."
74..76 Comment "//"
77..149 Comment "// Head uniformity binds each parameter once, for the whole family. Each"
150..221 Comment "// generator\'s result applies the family to the parameter variables, in"
222..298 Comment "// order, then to one term per index. So a generator cannot fix a parameter."
299..301 Comment "//"
302..375 Comment "// The family declares the varying parameter in its index telescope. Each"
376..449 Comment "// generator then states it at its result. A family whose index is a type"
450..523 Comment "// stores that type in a field, so it lives one universe above that type."
524..526 Comment "//"
527..542 Comment "// - see: #3404"
544..581 Comment "// The naturals the lengths count in."
